WEBVTT

00:06:58.463 --> 00:07:01.097
as a major supplier of vaccines

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:04.797
and not just vaccines,
but the entire supply chain.

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:10.663
We are now recognised
as the largest producer of vaccines,

00:07:10.663 --> 00:07:14.463
of syringes, of glass vials, of needles,

00:07:14.463 --> 00:07:17.397
because that was our original business.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:19.930
India was vaccinating the world,

00:07:19.930 --> 00:07:24.730
but it was actually vaccinating
low and middle-income countries

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:29.797
for the kind of vaccines
that you normally deploy worldwide

00:07:29.797 --> 00:07:31.863
to immunize children.